# Mock policy snippets

## HR-EXPENSES-001 (hr_expenses.pdf — page 3)

Daily per-diem for international travel is $75 USD for meals and $150 USD for incidentals. Employees must submit receipts for expenses greater than $25.

---

## IT-SHARED-002 (it_security.pdf — page 7)

Employees may use personal laptops only if endpoint security is installed and IT approval is granted. No corporate data should be stored on personal devices.

---

## CONTRACTOR-REMOTE-003 (hr_contracts.pdf — page 2)

Contractors may work remotely with manager approval; contractors are not authorised to access payroll systems unless explicitly granted by the payroll owner.

